{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_031_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e1781c4ea5b05404605e672473b1c05701a19f977429bdac83c0a1c420c2c40a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1bb359dbf54561cb30307e85fb1a38a2c49abfb530b3f04cd5fcc59db7cfa58",
      "text": "原来大学里流行那种美妆啊！\n很有成熟感，但是但是又好可爱☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60be6781343ac646ccee42447d87a3d9c0e8aa72b5eb3e24bba85362fed89614",
      "text": "嗯嗯，平时方不方便穿用果然很重要呢。\n那样的话，颜色和花纹就设计成这种感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aaaa186a023768a77d65393966f7c930c9af62bf836c5cc5bd312f2c4c26857",
      "text": "……啊！那款美妆，我们高中也超有人气的！\n我也有哦。啪噼地撞款了呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af73fff8ca383d1791847c692cf313a8005a2e42c1cadd33f5fc050b022d701f",
      "text": "（咲先生聊得也很投机呢。太好了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15d92a09a879166ef3f8f58d4d758cc74dd21c60f86c779fa7be05d649bd2fc8",
      "text": "（这样的话，一定能构思出\n很棒的设计……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000065:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:934c914903ad2a12e920d456bcc35a652c8d787868a84b056837b150480f8bcc",
      "text": "各位，今天真的很感谢大家。\n能聊这么多话题，超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c92fd1d1ee041cc98281d498b93bafa828316c765d7b53e7561dfebd6d92b802",
      "text": "多亏了大家，我想到了很多好点子哦。\n大家敬请期待成品的出炉吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31a78f41b12b3da67526f255659dad947b641153b3429534d900e5416d08eba3",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n聊得非常热烈呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf81188456bf5d07701fca8e746362ebcf6b080936d748ea10216fb3de2c19c",
      "text": "嗯！一开始虽然很紧张，\n但聊开之后时间一下子就过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_031sak_01_1_2_031_01:1_2_031_01_d:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:386056972a30c98c07947ca4226e50aaac7d0600c20c182bd5f8fb6409a161cf",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿。\n和大家一起分享“可爱”，真美好呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
